---
# QuickJS integration - disable all checks. This directory is glue against a C
# library with its own conventions, and holding it to the engine's style rules
# produces a diagnostic per line and no defect.
#
# A consequence worth knowing before you invoke clang-tidy on a file here by
# hand: an empty check list is a *usage error* to clang-tidy, so it prints its
# help and exits 1 rather than reporting nothing. Pass `--allow-no-checks`,
# which is what the pre-commit hook and the CI lint step both do.
Checks: '-*'
...
